WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.119
An inhaled drug carrier may behave well during

00:00:04.119 --> 00:00:07.688
preparation yet fail at the first real delivery step.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.355
My master's research explores dexamethasone-loaded niosomes

00:00:17.355 --> 00:00:21.911
and proniosomes, including surfactant and cholesterol composition.

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:32.541
Particle size, formulation chemistry and loading measurements belong

00:00:32.541 --> 00:00:36.948
to a reproducible analytical programme before aerosol testing.

00:00:43.008 --> 00:00:46.276
A vesicle must withstand aerosol generation

00:00:46.276 --> 00:00:49.544
before deposition is even a meaningful question.

00:00:54.300 --> 00:00:58.824
Planned aerosol assessment asks about output, distribution and the fraction

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:03.349
that reaches a target region, not just the vial formulation.

00:01:09.508 --> 00:01:13.980
The thesis is ongoing. I am showing the research design

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:18.451
and what must be measured, not claiming encapsulation or therapeutic success.
